# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). 6/8, a low clarinet, a marimba ostinato that
# already has the half step in it, pizzicato off-beats, the Phrygian Eb in the second half.
title    Swamp
composer Claude
about    Glowing caps over acid pools, where the glass bird broke, in 6/8: a low clarinet in D minor over a marimba ostinato that already has the crack's half step in it, pizzicato off-beats, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass, a dark Eb in the second half; the bird's calls are half steps. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, conga and guiro; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    58
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead pizz ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart conga guiro pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -guiro horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     clarinet   vol=0.6  pan=-0.1 rev=0.4
voice pizz     pizz       vol=0.36 pan=0.3  center=D4 gate=0.5
voice ost      marimba    vol=0.45 pan=-0.4
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice conga    conga      vol=0.45 pan=0.3
voice guiro    guiro      vol=0.18 pan=0.4
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    marimba    vol=0.55 pan=-0.35 gate=0.55 rev=0.2
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

